{"id":"663978","name":"鲫鱼豆腐汤","author":"凤梨小厨房","authorId":"8998709","desc":"","cover":"images/663978/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲫鱼","amount":"1条"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"1块"}],"sub":[{"name":"芫茜","amount":"50g"},{"name":"姜","amount":"3片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鱼让老板杀好回来洗干净，两面抹一点盐，姜切片，芫茜洗净切段。","img":"images/663978/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"热锅凉油把鲫鱼，豆腐都煎两面金黄。","img":"images/663978/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入姜片和开水。","img":"images/663978/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大火烧开，中火煮5分钟。","img":"images/663978/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"中间翻一次鱼。","img":"images/663978/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入芫茜和适量盐。","img":"images/663978/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再大火烧开后关火。","img":"images/663978/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"浓浓的鱼汤是春天给孩子补钙的快手汤水。","img":"images/663978/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}